// Workspace for local development: inside this checkout every module resolves
// its siblings from the working tree rather than from the module proxy, so a
// change to e.g. nabu is immediately visible to noty with no go get dance.
//
// The go.work file is local-only - consumers of these modules never see it, and
// resolve each module through the pseudo-versions in its own go.mod.  The
// "standalone" CI job builds and tests every module with GOWORK=off to make
// sure those stay correct.
//
// Do not run "go work sync".  It rewrites every module's go.mod to the
// workspace-wide maximum dependency version and drops go.sum entries the
// modules need when built on their own.  Nothing else needs it: build, test,
// vet and mod tidy all leave the modules' go.mod and go.sum alone.

go 1.25.0

use (
	./bunch
	./eztime
	./htt9
	./iotest
	./nabu
	./noty
	./nummap
	./oil
	./singleton
	./tailer
	./vle
)
